{'symbol': 'FOXA', 'date': '2022-06-09 12:00:00', 'title': 'FOX CORPORATION CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER STEVE TOMSIC TO PARTICIPATE IN UPCOMING CREDIT SUISSE 24TH ANNUAL COMMUNICATIONS CONFERENCE', 'text': 'NEW YORK AND LOS ANGELES , JUNE 9, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FOX CORPORATION (NASDAQ: FOXA, FOX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER STEVE TOMSIC WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE CREDIT SUISSE 24TH ANNUAL COMMUNICATIONS CONFERENCE ON JUNE 14, AT APPROXIMATELY 9:30AM (EASTERN), 6:30AM (PACIFIC). A LIVE AND ARCHIVED WEBCAST OF THE PRESENTATION WILL BE AVAILABLE AT INVESTOR.FOXCORPORATION.COM.'}